### Variables
@apiUrl = http://localhost:40287

### 1. Healthz
GET {{apiUrl}}/healthz

### 2. Metrics
GET {{apiUrl}}/prometheus

### 3. Login to trackgeek-api
# @name login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jhondoe@example.com",
  "password": "super-secure-password"
}

### 4. Sign out from trackgeek-api
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/sign-out

### 5. Get user info by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/id/{{login.response.body.user.id}}

### 6. Get user info by username
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/username/{{login.response.body.user.username}}

### 7.1 Search user by username
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/search?query=jhon

### 7.2 Search user by name
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/search?query=jane%20doe

### 8. Get user followers
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/follower?userId={{login.response.body.user.id}}

### 9 Follow user
POST {{apiUrl}}/user/follow/019d3fb8-dce9-715a-94a3-b093c0660f0e

### 5. Get user following
GET {{apiUrl}}/user/following?userId={{login.response.body.user.id}}

### 11. Unfollow user
POST {{apiUrl}}/user/unfollow/019d3fb8-dce9-715a-94a3-b093c0660f0e

### 12. Update profile
PATCH {{apiUrl}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

