{
  "overall": 5,
  "art": 5,
  "worldbuilding": 5,
  "summary": "This manga is amazing! I can't stop reading it. The story is captivating and the characters are well-developed. The artwork is top-notch and the storytelling is fantastic. I highly recommend it to anyone who loves action and adventure.",
  "notes": "I have read this manga multiple times and it never gets old. I always find something new to appreciate about it. The attention to detail is incredible and the creators clearly put a lot of love and care into making it. I can't wait for the next chapter!",
  "story": "This manga has a captivating story that keeps you hooked from start to finish. The plot is well-paced and full of twists and turns that keep you on the edge of your seat. The world-building is also fantastic, with a rich and immersive setting that feels alive and vibrant.",
  "characters": "The characters in this manga are incredibly well-developed and relatable. Each character has their own unique personality and backstory that adds depth and complexity to the story. The character development is also top-notch, with characters that grow and evolve over the course of the series.",
  "recommended": true,
  "mangaId": "019d4443-46e5-75aa-b589-bcf8562520cb"
}

